name = note;
value = "Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution Share Alike License (CC-BY-SA). Created by Fabian Schneider (fabianswebworld.de) for use in the 'ttxweb' teletext-to-html decoder project, this font is based upon inspirations taken from (1) the pixel font depicted in the ETSI Teletext standard documents, (2) the font found in the CGROM of dozens of teletext decoders since the late 1980s in several variations, (3) the Teletext font found in the OpenSUSE 'tv-fonts' package, creating a mashup with some glyph additions and variations to the author's own taste. Feel free to edit.";
